abstract: >-
  Raksha (Sanskrit: रक्षा, meaning protection) is a comprehensive
  infrastructure security monitoring and compliance platform. It provides
  real-time server monitoring, network scanning, database security auditing,
  automated compliance checking, ML-powered threat detection, and immutable
  audit trails.
